      "context": "English UI, translation ON. German question and all four German choices remain visible; English translations appear alongside. Toggling OFF hides only English. The choice persists across questions, reloads, and a temporary switch to German UI. Learning status follows chronological attempts: Not started (gray), Needs review after any wrong answer (red), Learning after one consecutive correct answer (orange), Learned after two or more (green). Wrong answers reset the streak. Study and completed mock tests share history; blanks, unfinished tests and session feedback resets do not change status. Learning and Learned each contribute once to progress. Each question accepts one answer per study session. No Retry question action. Previous and Next retain current-session answers and feedback. Entering Study again or opening a question from a learning-status filter in Progress starts a fresh session. Leaving study, changing mode or group, reloading, or restarting a completed pass clears session answers, but preserves positions, attempt history, learning status and progress. Study hides the brand header below 1024px, including tablets; navigation and safe-area spacing remain. Active question screens show a full-width status bar 8px below the scope title.",
