        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "a4mUhN",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 20,
          "y": 265.5,
          "name": "Abgabe Dialog",
          "context": "Modal dialog. Announce the title and the 32-unanswered consequence. Initial focus: Open question list. This action closes the dialog and focuses the 33-question navigator with choices preserved; Submit test opens the result and focuses its heading. Tab stays in the dialog. Escape cancels and returns focus to Submit test.",
