                      "context": "Combined status summary and filters. Counts cover the entire question bank, independent of the selected filter. Keep All and all four statuses visible. First use: All 310, Not started 310, other counts 0. Expose selected state and counts in accessible names. Wrap controls in semantic order for German labels and narrow layouts; never truncate labels or reduce targets below 44 px.",
