      "y": 16272,
      "name": "MOBILE / 08 Progress · Question status by group",
      "context": "Question status is the active tab. Filters apply globally to all 13 question groups; counts are bank-wide. Each group can expand independently, including multiple groups at once. Expanded groups initially show up to 10 matches in bank order, then append 10 per group. Filter changes reset each group to 10. Preserve state between tabs and question-history navigation. Full scroll content shown on canvas; mobile navigation remains fixed in the app with safe-area clearance.",
