                      "fill": "$text",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The installed app has separate storage from Safari. Progress does not transfer automatically. Export a backup in Safari, then import it in the installed app. Review the backup and confirm before replacing data.",
