          "type": "frame",
          "id": "mwXec",
          "name": "Telefon Navigation",
          "context": "Fixed to viewport bottom above all page controls, including selected language and appearance segments. Opaque surface, safe-area padding, and reserved content space. Main page content has an isolated stacking context; modal dialogs remain above navigation. Six equal navigation targets in order: Home, Study, Mock test, Progress, Cheat sheet, Settings. 86 px bar including 24 px illustrated safe area; 58 px targets. Labels reserve two lines; keep icon baselines aligned. Translate each item and expose its full accessible name.",
