              "id": "ELdHL",
              "name": "P2 · Reading hierarchy",
              "fill": "$text",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Expanded drawers / typography. Observed: all notes used the same regular weight. Judgment: important study terms were difficult to scan during revision. Fix: named terms and dates now lead their explanations in semibold, retaining every original fact.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ATN3J",
              "name": "P2 · Long-drawer recovery",
              "fill": "$text",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Expanded drawers / efficiency. Observed: a 35-entry group had only a header toggle. Judgment: closing after reading required a long return scroll. Fix: a 44 px Close group button at the end of every drawer, with heading focus restoration specified.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "MY3pA",
              "name": "P3 · Alignment",
              "fill": "$text",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Overview and mobile navigation / consistency. Observed: auto-width numbers shifted group labels; centered one- and two-line tabs staggered the icons. Fix: fixed-width number columns and uniform two-line label slots with aligned icons.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ciJI3",
              "name": "Preserved strengths",
              "fill": "$text",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Retained the existing palette, readable body size, source order, single-page structure, independent drawers, English mockups and Settings-driven EN/RU/DE behavior. Sources sections remain removed.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "qvuKL",
              "name": "Verification boundary",
              "fill": "$text",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Inspect rendered desktop/tablet/mobile and light/dark examples; compare all 212 source entries before and after. These are static designs. Keyboard, scroll restoration and translated runtime reflow remain implementation checks, not demonstrated browser behavior.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
